WEBVTT

00:00:02.030 --> 00:00:07.170
This good day, this holy night, shall be 
designated the Day of Saint Michellia,

00:00:07.170 --> 00:00:09.020
and made into a holiday!

00:00:09.020 --> 00:00:13.700
The holy palace knights will work even harder

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:17.070
to ensure that none harm Her Holiness!

00:00:24.140 --> 00:00:26.470
Hey, stop crying.

00:00:26.470 --> 00:00:27.620
Please!

00:00:27.940 --> 00:00:30.330
What do we do, Ravial?

00:00:30.330 --> 00:00:32.850
I know a good place.

00:00:33.370 --> 00:00:36.300
A place where no one will visit, 
where no one will harm them...

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:38.420
Where no one knows.

00:00:38.810 --> 00:00:39.780
Very well.

00:00:40.160 --> 00:00:41.230
Go.

00:00:43.110 --> 00:00:44.410
Ultos...

00:00:44.410 --> 00:00:47.220
Hurry. Before the festival ends.

00:01:02.550 --> 00:01:04.750
Commander, is this...?

00:01:05.160 --> 00:01:08.910
Send a messenger to all 
the holy palace guards.

00:01:08.910 --> 00:01:12.030
There's a chance that one of the 
groundlings has entered the holy city.

00:01:12.450 --> 00:01:16.350
Find them, no matter what,
 before the people of the city do!

00:01:16.350 --> 00:01:18.060
Y-Yes!

00:01:18.060 --> 00:01:23.100
But Her Holiness has requested 
that they not be harmed.

00:01:23.100 --> 00:01:24.390
Understood!

00:01:29.340 --> 00:01:33.500
If you'd stayed here in the tower,
I could've protected you,

00:01:34.920 --> 00:01:36.030
Ultos.

00:01:54.380 --> 00:01:57.220
<b>The Apathetic Boy and the Girl in a Bottle</b>

00:03:15.920 --> 00:03:19.880
<b>The Angel Who Couldn't Fly and the Holy Wings of Ten Thousand Prayers (Part 2)</b>

00:03:26.980 --> 00:03:29.090
It got cold all of a sudden.

00:03:29.790 --> 00:03:32.570
I didn't know being soaked 
with rain made you so cold.

00:03:34.200 --> 00:03:36.690
Let's rest a little, until the rain lets up.

00:03:37.210 --> 00:03:38.610
We were just getting started, too.

00:03:38.970 --> 00:03:41.600
This rain will just aggravate your injury.

00:03:50.790 --> 00:03:52.250
Sheesh...

00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:54.880
Once it stops,
we're going to buy some shoes.

00:03:55.460 --> 00:03:57.160
I don't like you.

00:03:57.160 --> 00:03:59.010
Where did that come from?

00:04:03.570 --> 00:04:05.240
Just half...

00:04:05.240 --> 00:04:08.480
I'd like to say stay a meter away, but...

00:04:08.480 --> 00:04:10.140
Thank you.

00:04:14.150 --> 00:04:18.540
Come to think of it, how were 
you going to get your wings?

00:04:19.010 --> 00:04:22.280
I was... just about to think of that.

00:04:23.290 --> 00:04:26.260
And you were giving me a hard time over that!

00:04:26.820 --> 00:04:28.960
I've never been outside that tower.

00:04:28.960 --> 00:04:30.730
How should I know?

00:04:33.860 --> 00:04:38.250
All right, we'll start gathering 
information while we go buy shoes.

00:04:38.250 --> 00:04:42.250
So, what will you do if 
you can't get your wings?

00:04:43.530 --> 00:04:45.270
Go back to the tower.

00:04:47.140 --> 00:04:52.880
There are lots of cities on the surface that 
are just as pretty as the Holy City.

00:04:53.300 --> 00:04:55.100
Don't lie to me.

00:04:55.100 --> 00:04:56.680
It's true!

00:04:56.680 --> 00:04:58.940
I've been to them myself.

00:04:58.940 --> 00:05:02.040
With this friend of yours?

00:05:02.040 --> 00:05:02.940
Yup.

00:05:05.580 --> 00:05:07.240
What?

00:05:08.200 --> 00:05:12.050
Is this "friend" of yours so important?

00:05:12.050 --> 00:05:13.210
Of course!

00:05:13.570 --> 00:05:16.550
But you might get caught.

00:05:16.970 --> 00:05:18.500
She's still important to me.

00:05:21.520 --> 00:05:26.300
Anyway, there are lots of pretty 
places outside this country.

00:05:26.300 --> 00:05:29.200
The ground still hasn't 
had its sins forgiven.

00:05:29.200 --> 00:05:30.660
I can't believe that.

00:05:30.660 --> 00:05:33.220
You're so stubborn.

00:05:40.370 --> 00:05:43.300
We'll preserve our stamina 
until the rain stops.

00:05:50.500 --> 00:05:52.810
The rain clouds are back now 
that the Cloud Eater is gone!

00:05:52.810 --> 00:05:54.820
God brought us rain!

00:05:55.810 --> 00:05:57.330
Thank you!

00:05:57.690 --> 00:06:01.120
Our comrades who suffer in pain,

00:06:01.120 --> 00:06:05.590
your prayers have been heard by Michellia.

00:06:07.670 --> 00:06:10.540
<i>I don't understand what 
Her Holiness is thinking</i>

00:06:10.540 --> 00:06:13.670
<i>when she says she wants to meet 
somebody from the surface.</i>

00:06:14.380 --> 00:06:17.310
You must remain separated from 
the sins of the groundlings.

00:06:17.650 --> 00:06:21.040
Or God may take your wings!

00:06:21.620 --> 00:06:23.860
<i>I've served her for three years,</i>

00:06:23.860 --> 00:06:26.590
<i>and I don't know the first thing 
about what's in her heart.</i>

00:06:39.120 --> 00:06:41.720
The entrance to the town 
is right there, but...

00:06:42.120 --> 00:06:44.210
Is there no other way in?

00:06:44.210 --> 00:06:46.250
There's nothing but cliffs around here.

00:06:46.250 --> 00:06:47.880
M-Monsters!

00:06:57.270 --> 00:06:59.780
You're sure this is the right way?

00:06:59.780 --> 00:07:02.700
Yeah. I've seen this city 
every day from the tower.

00:07:02.700 --> 00:07:03.690
I know the way.

00:07:04.600 --> 00:07:05.660
This is it.

00:07:05.940 --> 00:07:10.190
This is the place, but we 
can't get in without wings.

00:07:10.190 --> 00:07:11.500
Hey...

00:07:15.050 --> 00:07:17.810
Yeah, I think it'll work.

00:07:17.810 --> 00:07:19.260
What are you doing?

00:07:19.260 --> 00:07:23.080
Even if you can't fly, if you have legs,
 you can climb the wall.

00:07:23.080 --> 00:07:25.280
C-Climb?

00:07:25.280 --> 00:07:29.070
Don't tell me you can't climb 
a little wall like this.

00:07:29.070 --> 00:07:31.250
O-Of course I can!

00:07:36.730 --> 00:07:38.120
Just like that!

00:07:42.010 --> 00:07:43.770
Sorry.

00:07:44.400 --> 00:07:46.260
You don't sound like you mean it!

00:07:47.290 --> 00:07:49.290
They'll be suspicious of a groundling.

00:07:49.290 --> 00:07:50.530
Stay here.

00:07:50.960 --> 00:07:53.970
You don't need to practice buying
something for the first time?

00:07:53.970 --> 00:07:56.120
You just pay money, right?

00:07:56.600 --> 00:07:58.030
Hey!

00:07:58.850 --> 00:08:01.790
Does he even have money?

00:08:02.430 --> 00:08:03.790
Welcome!

00:08:04.150 --> 00:08:05.790
U-Um...

00:08:07.540 --> 00:08:13.550
Um... I hurt my leg and 
wings in an accident.

00:08:13.550 --> 00:08:16.890
Oh, dear. Poor boy.

00:08:18.010 --> 00:08:21.350
So if I could get a pair of shoes...

00:08:21.350 --> 00:08:24.290
Shoes, right? Just a second.

00:08:32.460 --> 00:08:35.190
Here you go. Take these.

00:08:36.330 --> 00:08:38.130
Oh, right. The money...

00:08:38.130 --> 00:08:40.070
How much are they?

00:08:40.070 --> 00:08:44.090
It's fine. It must've been terrible,
hurting your wings.

00:08:44.720 --> 00:08:46.950
And it was probably no fun 
running through that rain.

00:08:47.360 --> 00:08:49.970
Cheer up, kiddo.

00:08:50.550 --> 00:08:52.300
Th-Thank you.

00:08:52.300 --> 00:08:53.590
It's fine!

00:08:53.590 --> 00:08:55.810
I guess it worked.

00:08:58.920 --> 00:09:02.790
Kid, today's the day of Saint Michellia.

00:09:02.790 --> 00:09:07.180
So go see Her Holiness and ask 
for her to help heal you.

00:09:07.180 --> 00:09:09.310
The Day of Saint Michellia?

00:09:09.710 --> 00:09:13.450
Her Holiness will pass on any 
message from the Sky People to God,

00:09:13.450 --> 00:09:15.830
so long as they believe.

00:09:16.820 --> 00:09:22.150
Want me to ask my husband to 
carry you to the Holy Palace?

00:09:22.150 --> 00:09:24.860
Thank you, but I'm here with someone.

00:09:25.270 --> 00:09:27.570
Thank you so much for the shoes.

00:09:27.570 --> 00:09:29.180
Be careful!

00:09:31.510 --> 00:09:33.660
You were listening, huh?

00:09:34.730 --> 00:09:36.700
I was w-worried!

00:09:36.700 --> 00:09:38.220
Well you shouldn't have been!

00:09:38.520 --> 00:09:42.050
By the way, who is "Her Holiness"?

00:09:42.050 --> 00:09:44.970
That's who they took Merc to.

00:09:45.360 --> 00:09:47.900
Her Holiness is the closest being to God.

00:09:47.900 --> 00:09:50.890
Her task is to carry our wishes to God.

00:09:51.400 --> 00:09:54.990
So that means your friend 
is in the Holy Palace.

00:09:55.430 --> 00:10:01.070
Do you think that person might 
grant your wish for wings?

00:10:02.660 --> 00:10:04.200
Maybe she would!

00:10:10.470 --> 00:10:15.000
Oh, my, you're with the Holy Palace Guards!

00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:17.510
One meter radius!

00:10:18.040 --> 00:10:20.140
Now's not the time!

00:10:20.550 --> 00:10:22.160
Are you looking for something?

00:10:22.160 --> 00:10:25.050
No, I was just passing through.

00:10:25.050 --> 00:10:26.190
Don't worry about me.

00:10:26.190 --> 00:10:27.400
Oh, right.

00:10:27.710 --> 00:10:33.510
Does the Commander of the Holy Palace 
Guards have a much younger brother?

00:10:34.740 --> 00:10:36.730
No. Why?

00:10:36.730 --> 00:10:39.800
A kid just came to my shop,

00:10:39.800 --> 00:10:45.230
and he looked just like the 
commander did when he was young!

00:10:46.170 --> 00:10:48.670
But the commander doesn't 
have a younger brother.

00:10:48.670 --> 00:10:50.640
Oh, he doesn't?

00:10:51.800 --> 00:10:53.390
Let's hurry to the palace.

00:10:53.390 --> 00:10:54.320
Yeah.

00:11:00.380 --> 00:11:04.920
If we climb up these, we should 
be able to get to the palace.

00:11:05.320 --> 00:11:07.380
Climb up them?

00:11:07.380 --> 00:11:10.900
You aren't going to tell me
 you can't do it, are you?

00:11:12.040 --> 00:11:13.640
Of course I can.

00:11:13.640 --> 00:11:14.860
Here we go!

00:11:33.220 --> 00:11:35.050
You're awake?

00:11:35.050 --> 00:11:37.770
Merc-san, I'm sorry.

00:11:37.770 --> 00:11:39.770
I left you alone.

00:11:39.770 --> 00:11:41.760
Don't worry.

00:11:41.760 --> 00:11:47.970
You must be tired after all that praying.

00:11:47.970 --> 00:11:49.840
I'm fine, too.

00:11:50.920 --> 00:11:52.110
Merc-san...

00:11:53.670 --> 00:11:58.760
Do you know why they called me the 
Holy Maiden and brought me here?

00:11:59.730 --> 00:12:03.200
These wings are a sign of God's love.

00:12:03.590 --> 00:12:07.220
Even if I can't move them now, 
eventually, I've always been told,

00:12:07.220 --> 00:12:11.460
I'll grow up enough that 
I can flap them and fly to God.

00:12:12.200 --> 00:12:13.960
But, Merc-san,

00:12:13.960 --> 00:12:20.380
no matter how much time passes, 
or how much my body grows,

00:12:20.380 --> 00:12:23.470
I cannot fly with these wings.

00:12:23.470 --> 00:12:25.240
Why?

00:12:25.990 --> 00:12:27.180
Because...

00:12:33.970 --> 00:12:36.070
It was easier to get in than I thought.

00:12:36.650 --> 00:12:38.930
Like hell it is.

00:12:38.930 --> 00:12:42.070
I almost fell off!

00:12:42.070 --> 00:12:43.520
You're exaggerating.

00:12:43.900 --> 00:12:45.770
Come on! Let's go!

00:12:45.770 --> 00:12:47.770
W-Wait!

00:12:49.080 --> 00:12:52.200
The people of this country 
entrust me with their prayers,

00:12:52.200 --> 00:12:55.460
believing that someday I will fly to Heaven.

00:12:56.070 --> 00:13:01.840
But with these heavy wings, 
I will never be able to fly.

00:13:02.760 --> 00:13:06.510
Wings are a sign that ancient 
sins have been forgiven.

00:13:07.100 --> 00:13:12.180
We are the Sky People, chosen by God 
and allowed to come close to Heaven.

00:13:12.620 --> 00:13:20.560
And yet, these wings tie me to 
the earth, like the people below,

00:13:20.560 --> 00:13:22.410
and try to crush me.

00:13:26.040 --> 00:13:27.850
I want to know...

00:13:27.850 --> 00:13:29.410
I want to know God.

00:13:29.920 --> 00:13:33.030
But just as much as I want to know Him,

00:13:33.760 --> 00:13:36.610
I want to be rid of these wings.

00:13:37.650 --> 00:13:38.800
Then...

00:13:42.640 --> 00:13:45.620
Give those wings to me.

00:13:47.260 --> 00:13:50.760
<b>The Apathetic Boy and the Girl in a Bottle</b>

00:13:53.340 --> 00:13:55.240
Hey...

00:13:55.240 --> 00:13:58.530
Did you really have to
appear so suddenly like that?

00:13:58.530 --> 00:13:59.690
Yuu-san!

00:14:00.690 --> 00:14:01.940
Merc!

00:14:02.270 --> 00:14:03.320
Yuu-san!

00:14:04.390 --> 00:14:06.410
I'm sorry I'm late!

00:14:06.410 --> 00:14:09.360
How did you make it this far?

00:14:09.360 --> 00:14:11.500
It was tough.

00:14:11.500 --> 00:14:14.690
Jeez! You should've gotten here sooner!

00:14:14.690 --> 00:14:15.950
Sorry...

00:14:17.020 --> 00:14:18.450
Is this...

00:14:18.450 --> 00:14:22.590
Yes! This is Yuu-san, the healer, 
who travels with me!

00:14:22.590 --> 00:14:23.320
And this is...

00:14:23.320 --> 00:14:24.210
Hey.

00:14:25.370 --> 00:14:27.460
Tell me more about these 
wings you want to be rid of.

00:14:28.280 --> 00:14:33.620
I came here hoping to ask God for wings.

00:14:33.620 --> 00:14:36.420
Are you Ravial's...?

00:14:37.820 --> 00:14:40.980
Why not get down from there, Ultos?

00:14:43.530 --> 00:14:45.610
With the light of dawn,

00:14:46.020 --> 00:14:47.790
wings will be lost,

00:14:48.210 --> 00:14:49.890
and wings will be gained.

00:14:51.230 --> 00:14:54.080
This is the first magic I 
gained as the Holy Maiden.

00:14:54.080 --> 00:14:58.580
I will give you half 
these wings, as you ask.

00:15:00.620 --> 00:15:02.910
Your Holiness, is something wrong?

00:15:02.910 --> 00:15:04.080
Excuse me—

00:15:04.080 --> 00:15:05.930
Wh-Who are you?

00:15:06.280 --> 00:15:07.210
Pestia?

00:15:07.210 --> 00:15:08.220
Yes?

00:15:08.910 --> 00:15:11.460
I want your help with something.

00:15:18.340 --> 00:15:21.480
I will now perform the 
Ritual of Falling Wings.

00:15:21.880 --> 00:15:25.080
I want your help with it.

00:15:29.530 --> 00:15:30.880
H-Hey...

00:15:30.880 --> 00:15:32.940
Don't get too close to the edge!

00:15:35.500 --> 00:15:37.730
This is such a pretty town.

00:15:37.730 --> 00:15:40.000
Are there sights like this on the ground?

00:15:41.810 --> 00:15:45.000
Yeah, it really is pretty.

00:15:45.400 --> 00:15:47.800
Starting next year,

00:15:47.800 --> 00:15:50.750
I'll be one of the shining 
lights within the holy city.

00:15:52.470 --> 00:15:56.000
It would've been perfect if 
I turned sixteen tomorrow.

00:15:56.000 --> 00:15:58.650
Today's your birthday?

00:15:58.650 --> 00:15:59.780
Yup.

00:16:00.450 --> 00:16:01.680
Happy birthday.

00:16:02.790 --> 00:16:05.690
Happy sixteenth birthday.

00:16:05.690 --> 00:16:09.310
Well, you may not want to hear that from me.

00:16:11.840 --> 00:16:13.390
These are tears of joy.

00:16:13.390 --> 00:16:16.250
'Cause I'll be rid of you soon.

00:16:16.250 --> 00:16:19.190
Well, I'm not happy about them.

00:16:24.450 --> 00:16:28.470
Your Holiness, preparations for the 
Ritual of Falling Wings are complete.

00:16:28.470 --> 00:16:30.380
Thank you, Pestia.

00:16:30.760 --> 00:16:33.670
You're sure about this?

00:16:33.670 --> 00:16:36.120
If you lose your wings...

00:16:38.130 --> 00:16:41.580
Merc-san, just as you 
search for your own truth,

00:16:41.580 --> 00:16:44.640
I want to know the truth, as well.

00:16:45.060 --> 00:16:47.860
What happens after I lose my wings?

00:16:47.860 --> 00:16:50.440
I want to see, even if it costs me my life.

00:16:50.440 --> 00:16:52.390
That is my wish.

00:16:53.160 --> 00:16:54.210
Wish...

00:16:57.180 --> 00:16:59.670
Merc-san, what is your wish?

00:16:59.670 --> 00:17:01.250
I...

00:17:02.310 --> 00:17:07.530
I want to journey with Yuu-san, I think.

00:17:08.040 --> 00:17:11.290
I don't know what he thinks, though.

00:17:11.980 --> 00:17:12.950
Your Holiness!

00:17:13.520 --> 00:17:17.300
Commander Ravial discovered 
the escaped groundling!

00:17:20.980 --> 00:17:25.030
A groundling, and someone 
else without wings.

00:17:25.030 --> 00:17:27.490
One of them is of the Sky People.

00:17:27.890 --> 00:17:30.080
Boy with tainted wings,

00:17:30.080 --> 00:17:35.250
it was a coincidence that you 
were with the groundling, right?

00:17:36.150 --> 00:17:37.350
Brother...

00:17:38.550 --> 00:17:39.720
Answer me,

00:17:39.720 --> 00:17:42.750
or you'll be arrested, as well.

00:17:42.750 --> 00:17:44.610
I-I...

00:17:46.530 --> 00:17:47.850
I'm sorry!

00:17:48.580 --> 00:17:51.940
I'm the one... who told Ravial-sama.

00:17:52.510 --> 00:17:55.680
I don't care how you punish me.

00:17:56.430 --> 00:17:57.310
But...

00:17:58.050 --> 00:18:00.750
Even if it's what God wants,

00:18:00.750 --> 00:18:03.750
if you lose your wings, Your Holiness...

00:18:04.780 --> 00:18:07.340
This isn't what God wants.

00:18:07.340 --> 00:18:09.510
Then why?

00:18:09.510 --> 00:18:12.310
I don't understand what you're thinking—

00:18:14.310 --> 00:18:16.430
Y-Your Holiness...

00:18:18.010 --> 00:18:19.230
Um...

00:18:19.890 --> 00:18:22.870
Just as you don't understand me,

00:18:22.870 --> 00:18:24.310
to tell the truth,

00:18:24.750 --> 00:18:28.640
I don't actually know anything about God.

00:18:29.910 --> 00:18:32.110
So I wanted to know for sure...

00:18:32.970 --> 00:18:36.590
Whether or not God is real.

00:18:40.040 --> 00:18:43.530
<i>She's just a normal person, just like me.</i>

00:18:46.070 --> 00:18:49.140
<i>Just a kind, normal girl...</i>

00:18:56.890 --> 00:18:57.970
I...

00:18:59.110 --> 00:19:00.340
Ultos.

00:19:00.820 --> 00:19:04.620
I don't think I can hate you after all.

00:19:05.280 --> 00:19:07.440
I'll be fine.

00:19:07.850 --> 00:19:12.080
Now you can finally be a part of 
the Holy Capital, like you wanted.

00:19:13.020 --> 00:19:14.320
What's wrong?

00:19:14.320 --> 00:19:18.700
Tell me to keep at least a meter away,
 like you always do.

00:19:19.260 --> 00:19:22.540
Or I guess I should just walk away.

00:19:22.540 --> 00:19:24.260
W-Wait!

00:19:41.590 --> 00:19:43.950
Your Holiness, your wings!

00:20:15.850 --> 00:20:17.200
An angel...

00:20:17.200 --> 00:20:18.830
You're too late.

00:20:18.830 --> 00:20:21.050
I'm not an angel anymore.

00:20:21.940 --> 00:20:24.670
If you touch a groundling...

00:20:24.670 --> 00:20:25.640
It's fine.

00:20:26.250 --> 00:20:28.290
I don't want you to call me an angel.

00:20:28.740 --> 00:20:30.970
I want you to call me a friend.

00:20:33.060 --> 00:20:34.450
It's beautiful...

00:20:35.060 --> 00:20:39.720
What I wanted was something you 
can have even without wings.

00:20:40.460 --> 00:20:45.640
From now, I'll be able to love your world 
as much as I love the world of the sky.

00:20:46.830 --> 00:20:47.640
Thank you.

00:20:48.370 --> 00:20:50.930
I like you.

00:20:52.210 --> 00:20:53.150
Yeah...

00:20:56.680 --> 00:20:59.220
I was never able to see him.

00:20:59.620 --> 00:21:02.250
That's why I tried to be punished.

00:21:03.690 --> 00:21:08.690
God was here the whole time, in our hearts.

00:21:09.300 --> 00:21:12.150
I never needed wings.

00:21:12.150 --> 00:21:16.100
It's not the body I needed, but the heart...

00:21:18.660 --> 00:21:24.030
In this moment, she finally 
became the Holy Maiden.

00:21:25.940 --> 00:21:29.340
Commander, who's the boy with the wings?

00:21:29.340 --> 00:21:30.630
My brother.

00:21:32.130 --> 00:21:36.770
<i>There's no need to keep 
protecting his cage anymore.</i>

00:21:37.660 --> 00:21:42.250
How about I just keep going down,
and then we travel the world together.

00:21:42.250 --> 00:21:44.550
We can't leave Merc here.

00:21:45.250 --> 00:21:46.770
You're right.

00:21:46.770 --> 00:21:50.740
But I do want to enjoy 
this sky a little more...

00:21:50.740 --> 00:21:52.030
Sure thing.

00:23:25.590 --> 00:23:27.580
It's finally time!

00:23:27.580 --> 00:23:29.010
Finally time!

00:23:29.010 --> 00:23:31.360
With all the thanks we can give...

00:23:31.360 --> 00:23:33.440
...for those of you who've 
supported us this far...

00:23:33.440 --> 00:23:35.320
Next time, the final episode!

00:23:33.590 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>The Healer and the Friend in a Bottle</b>

00:23:35.320 --> 00:23:37.560
"The Healer and the Friend in a Bottle."

00:23:37.560 --> 00:23:40.090
See you then!
